msgctxt "64"
msgid "I don't wanna fuckin' hear it. Get the hell outta here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "(What was that? It sounded like it came from the alley.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Ibuki, you bastard... If you ever poke your nose where it\r\n"
"doesn't belong again, it'll be the last thing you ever do!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Enough of this! Doing this to me isn't going to change\r\n"
"anything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Shut yer yap!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr "Uff..."

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"This is your last warning. Don't ever show your face\r\n"
"around here again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Hey, you all right?"
msgstr "Ehi, sei a posto?"

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Yeah... Thanks for stopping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "You're hurt. Do you need help?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Don't worry. It's nothing... Wait! Are you... Kiryu-san!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "You know me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"I used to be a member of the Dojima Family. My name is\r\n"
"Ibuki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Ibuki...? Sorry, but I don't remember you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Back then, I was just a flunky, so it's not surprising you\r\n"
"don't remember me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Is that right? ...Sorry. I don't remember."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"No, it's fine. It was over ten years ago...\r\n"
"Gah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Hey, you don't look so good. I can't just leave you here. I'll make sure you"
" get home safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Thank you... Thank you so much."
msgstr "Grazie... Grazie di cuore!"

